# Rust style surface

- Line width **100**; method chains prefer `chain_width` **80** (`rustfmt.toml`).
- Keep `.rs` files under ~**500** lines. `src/gbdt/mod.rs` and `src/cluster.rs`
  are near the ceiling—extract modules instead of growing them.
- Public items: `///` docs; modules: `//!`. Fallible pubs include `# Errors`.
- Prefer `#[expect(...)]` over `#[allow(...)]` for intentional lint exceptions.
- Match the Clippy allow-list in `Cargo.toml`; do not blanket-allow new lints.
- Spaces only (4-space indent); trailing commas in multi-line lists; no trailing
  whitespace; at most one blank line between items.
- Single `#[derive(A, B, ...)]` attribute (not stacked derives).
